{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/WishlistGif.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/\u0418\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0438\u044fEn.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character stands on the brink of despair, having lost someone dear to him. In an attempt to cope with the loss and find meaning in life, he encounters a mysterious stranger. This enigmatic figure offers him an unusual path to healing\u2014a journey into the depths of his own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As he dives into his consciousness, the hero discovers that familiar places from his past have turned into distorted realms, where every corner is filled with nightmares. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/\u0412\u0438\u043d\u044c\u0435\u0442\u043a\u0430.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/GifSteam.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/\u0418\u0433\u0440\u0430En.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game offers a blend of psychological horror and exploration. Terrifying creatures lurk around every corner, each one embodying the protagonist\u2019s deepest fears. Explore a variety of distorted locations drawn from his memories, solve puzzles, and uncover long-buried secrets from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the journey, you'll face a range of enemies, each representing a specific aspect of the protagonist\u2019s trauma and inner struggles. Atmospheric sound design, immersive audio, and haunting music work together to create a deeply engaging experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/\u0412\u0438\u043d\u044c\u0435\u0442\u043a\u0430.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0441\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0436En.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist must navigate the dark landscapes of their mind, uncovering the secrets of their subconscious and facing demons long hidden in the shadows. The journey will be not only a struggle to save a friend but also a quest for the true self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/WMonster.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3099580/extras/\u0412\u0438\u043d\u044c\u0435\u0442\u043a\u0430.png?t=1750476050\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wardrobe.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommu